OL,3,CMurder investigation after body found
OL,4,Cin search for missing Farnborough woman
OL,6,FPolice searching for a missing 58-year-
OL,7,Fold woman from Farnborough in
OL,8,FHampshire have found a body.
OL,10,FOfficers looking for Janna Fuller made
OL,11,Fthe discovery at an address on Cross
OL,12,FStreet in the North Camp area of the
OL,13,Ftown on Monday. (27 July)
OL,15,FHampshire Police say due to the
OL,16,Fcircumstances at the scene, four men
OL,17,Fwere arrested on suspicion of murder.
OL,19,FA 47-year-old man from Farnborough has
OL,20,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,21,Fand remains in custody.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
