PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785424693
OL,3,CMurder investigation after body found
OL,4,Cin search for missing Farnborough woman
OL,6,FA 52-year-old man, a 33-year-old man
OL,7,Fand a 29-year-old man, all from
OL,8,FFarnborough, were also arrested on
OL,9,Fsuspicion of murder. They have been
OL,10,Fbailed with conditions, pending
OL,11,Ffurther enquiries.
OL,13,FDetective Chief Inspector Gemma Hunter
OL,14,Fsaid: "We know that this incident will
OL,15,Fcause concern in the local community,
OL,16,Fhowever I would like to reassure you
OL,17,Fthat our officers have launched a full
OL,18,Finvestigation to establish the exact
OL,19,Fcircumstances of what has happened.
